// Golden fixtures for the M3 loop-filter layers (8.7.2 deblocking and
// 8.7.3 SAO), generated by tools/gen_loopfilter_golden.mjs from the real
// upstream Go deblock()/applySAO() truth, verified value-for-value by
// tools/crosscheck_loopfilter.mjs against an independent from-the-spec
// transcription. The MoonBit loopfilter package must reproduce every value.
//
// In/Out planes are raw 8-bit bytes. Int32 carriers are used for the pure
// derivation tables (beta/tc, plan decisions, offsets), matching the spec.

